784.9,"words":[{"text":"And","start":779.72,"end":779.86},{"text":"then","start":779.86,"end":780.02},{"text":"we","start":780.02,"end":780.06},{"text":"can","start":780.06,"end":780.24},{"text":"lift","start":780.24,"end":780.44},{"text":"our","start":780.44,"end":780.7},{"text":"hand","start":780.7,"end":781.08},{"text":"a","start":781.08,"end":781.32},{"text":"few","start":781.32,"end":781.42},{"text":"centimeters","start":781.42,"end":781.9},{"text":"above","start":781.9,"end":782.34},{"text":"our","start":782.34,"end":782.7},{"text":"head","start":782.7,"end":782.82},{"text":"and","start":782.82,"end":783.08},{"text":"see","start":783.08,"end":783.46},{"text":"what","start":783.46,"end":783.88},{"text":"we","start":784.32,"end":784.56},{"text":"feel.","start":784.56,"end":784.9}]},{"text":"We can take that hand down and hold our left hand above our head just to see if there's any difference in sensation and take it down again.","start":790.8,"end":805.8,"words":[{"text":"We","start":790.8,"end":790.88},{"text":"can","start":790.88,"end":790.88},{"text":"take","start":790.88,"end":791.08},{"text":"that","start":791.08,"end":791.38},{"text":"hand","start":791.38,"end":791.6},{"text":"down","start":791.6,"end":792.02},{"text":"and","start":792.02,"end":792.38},{"text":"hold","start":792.38,"end":792.6},{"text":"our","start":792.6,"end":792.88},{"text":"left","start":792.88,"end":793.12},{"text":"hand","start":793.12,"end":793.4},{"text":"above","start":793.4,"end":793.62},{"text":"our","start":793.62,"end":793.92},{"text":"head","start":793.92,"end":794.08},{"text":"just","start":794.08,"end":794.38},{"text":"to","start":794.38,"end":794.56},{"text":"see","start":794.56,"end":794.86},{"text":"if","start":795.74,"end":796.04},{"text":"there's","start":796.04,"end":796.22},{"text":"any","start":796.22,"end":796.36},{"text":"difference","start":796.36,"end":796.86},{"text":"in","start":796.86,"end":797.28},{"text":"sensation","start":797.28,"end":797.82},{"text":"and","start":797.82,"end":798.46},{"text":"take","start":804.66,"end":804.9},{"text":"it","start":804.9,"end":805.16},{"text":"down","start":805.16,"end":805.3},{"text":"again.","start":805.3,"end":805.8}]},{"text":"We can keep our attention there above our head, ideally in thoughtless awareness, which might just last for a few moments, a state of inner peace without thoughts, completely aware of the surroundings.","start":811.58,"end":828.2,"words":[{"text":"We","start":811.58,"end":811.62},{"text":"can","start":811.62,"end":811.86},{"text":"keep","start":811.86,"end":812.12},{"text":"our","start":812.12,"end":812.36},{"text":"attention","start":812.36,"end":812.72},{"text":"there","start":812.72,"end":813.14},{"text":"above","start":813.14,"end":813.42},{"text":"our","start":813.42,"end":813.72},{"text":"head,","start":813.72,"end":814.38},{"text":"ideally","start":815.9,"end":816.26},{"text":"in","start":816.26,"end":816.52},{"text":"thoughtless","start":816.52,"end":816.92},{"text":"awareness,","start":816.92,"end":817.96},{"text":"which","start":819.5,"end":819.56},{"text":"might","start":819.56,"end":819.74},{"text":"just","start":819.74,"end":820.06},{"text":"last","start":820.06,"end":820.32},{"text":"for","start":820.32,"end":820.66},{"text":"a","start":820.66,"end":820.84},{"text":"few","start":820.84,"end":820.88},{"text":"moments,","start":820.88,"end":821.96},{"text":"a","start":822.88,"end":822.94},{"text":"state","start":822.94,"end":823.14},{"text":"of","start":823.14,"end":823.46},{"text":"inner","start":823.46,"end":823.68},{"text":"peace","start":823.68,"end":824.12},{"text":"without","start":824.12,"end":824.54},{"text":"thoughts,","start":824.54,"end":825.56},{"text":"completely","start":826.12,"end":826.52},{"text":"aware","start":826.52,"end":827.02},{"text":"of","start":827.02,"end":827.34},{"text":"the","start":827.34,"end":827.5},{"text":"surroundings.","start":827.5,"end":828.2}]},{"text":"If thoughts do come, just try to observe them, let th